= Internal power struggle

Our currents are fighting for the control over the party. Which way should we support?

Left - Supports revolutionary course, reconciliation with KPD and class war against bourgeiouisie.

Center - Supports middle course, insisting that the conditions of revolution must come.

Labor - Pragmatic unionists, advocating for uncompromissive stance on rights of workers.

Reformist - Pragmatic reformists, advocating for the governance to push forward socialist policies and eventual transition of economy.

[? if neorevisionism: Neorevisionism - Supports the militant republicanism to save the republic from the claws of extremism and seeks to limit it by any means given. ?]
